From 67c1d1b5495af3b16a680ac6ec2ba04a14cbe73d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 15:01:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: repair boot blockers, close API gaps, and wire
 unreachable features

Backend no longer starts: six independent failures crashed module load
before app.listen(). Frontend rendered its main screen with no data.

Boot blockers
- request.controller.js: add the missing listRequests / updateRequestStatus
  handlers (they had been pasted into request.routes.js, where the duplicate
  declarations were a syntax error). Both scope by clinicId.
- notification.controller.js: implement the four handlers the router imports;
  the file was 0 bytes. All queries filter on req.user.id.
- reviewSync.service.js: drop a default import of apiResponse.js, which has
  no default export.
- Dashboard.jsx: move useDispatch/useSelector/useEffect out of module scope
  and into the component.

Entry point and billing funnel
- package.json: point start/dev at server.js, not the nonexistent
  src/server.js.
- axios.helper.js: import the store. Every 403 UPGRADE_REQUIRED threw a
  ReferenceError instead of opening the upgrade modal.

API contract
- Mount plans.routes.js and route getCredits at /subscription/credits; both
  were written but never reachable.
- Serve health at /api/v1/health as well as /health, and point the client at
  the path that exists.
- Remove getUserActivity: /activity has no backend and nothing rendered it.

Security
- AppBootstrap: gate the demo-session branch behind DEMO_AUTH_ENABLED.
  Unguarded, setting localStorage.token = "mock-token" rendered a fake admin
  session in production, and the demo credentials shipped in the bundle.
  Verified absent from dist/ after the change.

Reliability
- Single-flight the token refresh. The backend rotates refresh tokens, so
  concurrent 401s raced and logged the user out mid-session.
- 60s timeout for /reviews/sync and campaign create; the 10s default aborted
  client-side while the server completed, and the retry double-sent.

Frontend wiring
- Dashboard: fetch reviews, render loading/error/empty via the existing
  ReviewsQueueState, show SyncNowButton, derive stats from real data.
- NotificationBell: fetch on mount and persist mark-read/dismiss. The hook
  had been writing to a slice nothing rendered.
- Add the /onboarding route and send new signups there.
- TabSecurity: make the password form call changeUserPassword.

Cleanup
- Delete 16 dead files (stranded routes/index.js, second pg pool, unused
  requirePlan, 0-byte modules, duplicate axios client, foreign scaffolding).
- Move dev scripts to backend/scripts so their ../src imports resolve.
- Fix the pageTitle rules-of-hooks violation and a temporal-dead-zone access
  in GoogleConnect. Lint: 63 problems to 20, no-undef and rules-of-hooks
  both clear.

